  "catalog": {
    "slug": "school-lunch-line",
    "title": "School Lunch Line",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "author": "simetro",
    "description": "Cafeteria opens. 600 hungry kids, one hot line, and a 22-minute lunch period. Hot meals must hit trays before the bell rings.",
    "tags": [
      "sl1",
      "scenario_language_v1",
      "showcase",
      "daily_life",
      "tutorial"
    ],
    "palette_note": "Bright cafeteria white on slate; tomato red trays, carrot orange utensils, broccoli green salad, blueberry milk, grape jelly accents.",
    "layout_note": "Kitchen on the left preps trays; the serving line in the middle plates them; the cafeteria (dashboard) is where kids actually eat; a hall monitor (operator) watches the bell countdown.",
    "node_language_note": "source / compute_cluster / dashboard / operator. Compute_cluster is the serving line; the dashboard is the cafeteria itself.",
    "mover_path_note": "Movers do not exist yet for SL1 scenes; the legacy pieces.movers array is intentionally empty. SL1 links from kitchen to serving-line to cafeteria represent typed tray flow; the plating transform colocates on serving-line and the punch-ticket transform on cafeteria so the deterministic lunch pipeline runs without cross-place transport until the SL1 renderer ships.",
    "review_note": "Marked status=draft in the frontend catalog because the SL1 canvas renderer is not yet wired. Selecting this scene loads it successfully and shows catalog metadata in the scene browser. The SL1 HUD chips, dashboard freshness pill, and milestone strip render via the existing SL1 HUD overlay; the bespoke canvas vignette ships when the SL1 renderer is wired in a later PR."
  },
